title: A video keeps to its card while the canvas zooms, and what plays comes back when the canvas rests
folders: media

wait 3500
goto video/clip.mp4
wait 2500
open video/clip.mp4
wait 2500
mark playing
wait 600
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
mark zooming-out
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
zoom 0.94
wait 1500
mark rested-small
wait 600
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
mark zooming-in
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
zoom 1.1
wait 1500
mark rested-large
wait 600
quit
